1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,962
Rosa: Six miles of fuel. Eight miles to
the highway.

2
00:00:04,282 --> 00:00:08,803
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part three of ten: the last drop.

3
00:00:09,123 --> 00:00:12,816
Rosa: A ghost station. Pumps are dead.
Nobody gets off.

4
00:00:13,136 --> 00:00:17,568
Dante: Relax. In every game, there's a gas
can behind the station.

5
00:00:17,688 --> 00:00:18,884
Priya: This is not a game.

6
00:00:19,204 --> 00:00:21,681
Priya: That truck has a full tank. We
siphon it.

7
00:00:21,801 --> 00:00:23,035
Marcus: Why is everyone looking at me?

8
00:00:23,155 --> 00:00:24,027
Priya: You're tall.

9
00:00:24,347 --> 00:00:30,972
Priya: Rule: never use your mouth. Hose in
the tank. Can lower down. Gravity does the rest.

10
00:00:31,292 --> 00:00:34,264
Benny: I did track in high school. And
zombies love chicken.

11
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:35,593
Priya: That's not how that works.

12
00:00:35,913 --> 00:00:36,970
Benny: Cluck, cluck, cluck!

13
00:00:37,513 --> 00:00:41,433
Marcus: It's filling. It's filling.
It's... diesel in my mouth!

14
00:00:41,553 --> 00:00:42,991
Priya: I said never use your mouth!

15
00:00:43,311 --> 00:00:45,457
Rosa: Hurry. Please hurry.

16
00:00:45,777 --> 00:00:47,613
Rosa: Come on. Come on.

17
00:00:47,933 --> 00:00:49,313
Dante: Go go go!

18
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:50,600
Teddy: Where's Benny?

19
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,885
Rosa: We don't go back.

20
00:00:52,005 --> 00:00:53,104
Teddy: Gary says we GO BACK!

21
00:00:53,424 --> 00:00:58,825
BUS-E: Part three of ten, The Last Bus.
Next stop: the chicken. Follow for part four.

